			],
			"Message": "build(Mountain): Revert binary/library names to simplified \"Mountain\" identifier\n\nRevert the verbose development profile string (DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_ElectronProfile_EsbuildCompiler_Mountain) back to the simple \"Mountain\" name for binary, library, and default-run targets.\n\nThis simplifies the Tauri configuration by reverting productName and identifier to concise values (\"Mountain\" and \"land.editor.binary\" respectively). Also removes the duplicate \"Binary/node\" entry from externalBin in tauri.conf.json.\n\nBackup files (Cargo.toml.Backup, tauri.conf.json.Backup) are deleted as they are no longer needed.\n\nThe build pipeline continues to function correctly with the simplified naming scheme.",
			"SHA": "b490dcadccb30eb16c390a365632383d5aa1bcff"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-30T02:20:33Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				870,
				4
			],
			"Message": "build(Mountain): Update binary/lib names and Tauri config for development build profile\n\nRename the Mountain binary and library to include the full development environment profile string (DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_ElectronProfile_EsbuildCompiler_Mountain) to distinguish this build variant from production builds.\n\nUpdate tauri.conf.json productName and identifier to match, and add Binary/node to externalBin for the development node path.\n\nThis configuration supports the multi-profile build pipeline for debugging different environment configurations.",
			"SHA": "0a0e22ba2ddbef0b3b89c87ac9618f621f993889"
		}
	],
